// Icon names to files under assets/icons (WP3.6), written by tools/sf_icon_gen
// together with the PNGs. Unit definitions name an icon in `icon:`; a name that
// is not here but has a `<name>.png` next to this file works too. Two names
// with the same file share one picture (the decoy has the defence tower's).
// See docs/rules/icons.md.
